gathering.ponder.tag.mining=Mining
gathering.ponder.tag.mining.description=Ways to break blocks and gather what they drop
gathering.ponder.shared.drops=Once broken, the block drops %1$s

gathering.ponder.mining.header=Mining Ores
gathering.ponder.mining.text_1=Iron ore needs a stone pickaxe or better. Mined with anything weaker, it drops nothing
gathering.ponder.moss.header=Spreading Moss
gathering.ponder.moss.text_1=Bone meal on a moss block turns stone, dirt and similar blocks around it into moss
gathering.ponder.tnt.header=TNT
gathering.ponder.tnt.text_1=Flint and steel, fire or a redstone signal lights TNT. It hops up and explodes 4 seconds later
gathering.ponder.tnt.text_2=The blast breaks the blocks around it, and only some of them drop as items
gathering.ponder.lever_tnt.header=Lighting TNT with Redstone
gathering.ponder.lever_tnt.text_1=A lever, or any other signal reaching the TNT, lights it as well
